An existing tier README is never overwritten: with `{repo}/specs/README.md` already present, only
the missing vault symlink is created and the README keeps its content.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/home/Claude/probe/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      project:
        path: specs
-- fixtures/cwd/specs/README.md --
# Our specs

Hand-written, not the template.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/probe/sprints.md --
sprints
-- cmd --
booping specs init
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
linked {HOME}/Claude/probe/specs -> {CWD}/specs
{CWD}/specs
-- stderr --
